ii. The impugned judgment and award passed by the Tribunal in M.V.C.No.492/2017 dated 29.10.2021 is modified as under:
a) The claimants are entitled for compensation of Rs.15,15,052/- (Rupees Fifteen Lakhs Fifteen Thousand and Fifty Two only) as against Rs.6,21,000/- awarded by the Tribunal and they are entitled for enhancement of Rs.8,94,052/- with interest at the rate of 6% per annum from the date of petition till its payment on enhanced amount of compensation;
b) Respondent No.2 shall deposit the said amount within a period of Eight weeks from the date of receipt of certified copy of this order and it is at liberty to recover the same from Respondent No.1/Owner of the vehicle, since the - 20 - NC: 2023:KHC:41713-DB owner has violated terms and conditions of the policy of the insurance.

